760	  /// spec-5-3 — `MeusRegistrosScreen`'s own bridge to
761	  /// `EntriesSearchCubit` (Design Notes): every filter-mutating call site
762	  /// below also calls this cubit's own `updateFilters()`, right alongside
763	  /// [cubit]'s `applyFilters()`/`clearFilters()`, so a filter change
